      <div style="font-size: 1.02rem; line-height: 1.8; color: #cbd5e1;"><p>When you choose a reliable <strong>room shifting from Hyderabad to Karimnagar</strong> service, the first step is to secure the correct statutory transit paperwork. Every move that crosses state borders in India must be accompanied by a GST e‑Way bill, which is generated electronically through the GST portal.</p>
<p>This document tracks the movement of goods, ensures compliance with tax regulations, and provides a clear audit trail for both the sender and the receiver.</p>

<p style="font-size: 1.04rem; line-height: 1.75; color: #f1f5f9; font-weight: 500; margin-bottom: 12px;">In addition to the e‑Way bill, reputable <strong>packers and movers Karimnagar to Hyderabad</strong> will issue an IBA‑approved Lorry Receipt (LR/Bilty).</p>
